Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up at 7 o'clock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,just how it's supposed to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep a radiant smile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so the others see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Work on a regular pace
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,when someone tells you to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you obey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is so wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I be like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have tried to befriend them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like it's nature that drives me away from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,your designs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,what you like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,what you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,what you strive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine being like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in your bible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat all your cycles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The way you live is only causing me pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life's so dull
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But claim you know better
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.57,0:00:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I the one that's getting punished for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am divergent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,creative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,come give it a try
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I told you how to behave, you'd know the suffering of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you are better
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,no ember
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you surely know making my life into hell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
